cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the analysis plan, please cite it as below."
title: "India's active case-finding figures and the 100-day TB Mukt Bharat Abhiyaan: analysis code and pre-registered plan"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered analysis plan, and the code that implements it, for a study
  of India's published active case-finding (ACF) and TB Mukt Bharat Abhiyaan
  campaign figures: whether they are internally and mutually consistent,
  whether differences in definition, window or cut-off date explain their
  disagreements, what State-level ACF yields are, and whether TB
  notifications rose more, against each State's own trend, in States with a
  larger share of districts in phase 1 of the campaign.
type: software
authors:
